WEBVTT

00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:30.518
I'd say, "I'm sorry,

00:03:30.542 --> 00:03:35.351
why aren't the heterosexual
churchgoers disrupting this nonsense?"

00:03:35.375 --> 00:03:38.018
(Applause)

00:03:38.042 --> 00:03:39.292
Or ...

00:03:40.292 --> 00:03:44.309
in a room filled with boomers and Gen-Xers

00:03:44.333 --> 00:03:47.018
who started degrading
their millennial colleagues

00:03:47.042 --> 00:03:49.934
as being spoiled, lazy and overconfident,

00:03:49.958 --> 00:03:52.934
I'd say, "I'm sorry,

00:03:52.958 --> 00:03:57.208
why isn't someone my age
saying 'stop stereotyping?'"

00:03:57.667 --> 00:03:58.934
(Audience) Yes!

00:03:58.958 --> 00:04:02.143
(Applause)